    "description": "प्रारम्भ \n\nA calling that began in the chaos of 2020 —\nin silence, in stillness, in fear, in rage,\nin herbs, in food, in sound, in wilderness,\nin breath, in breathlessness,\nin joy, in pain, in loss, in gain —\nin the search for meaning of this tricky fun game.\n\nWhispers of Soonya. A remembering. A memory of our dharma. A space where you are held, as you are.\n\n#HolisticWellness  #ConsciousLiving #Ayurveda  #HolisticHealing  #ConsciousCommunity",
